  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ST&#xd6;D TILL  Result Based Management system/MINIRENA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supportive RBM/M&amp;E system/ MINIRENA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges ambassad i Kigali har kommit &#xf6;verens om att st&#xf6;dja MINIRENA genom ig&#xe5;ngs&#xe4;ttning av konsulttj&#xe4;nster f&#xf6;r att utveckla effektiva funktionella M * E infrastruktur till st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r ENR sektorn i arbetet med att uppn&#xe5; de nationella m&#xe5;len om h&#xe5;llbar utveckling genom framg&#xe5;ngsrik till&#xe4;mpning av strategier och andra resultat k&#xf6;rde nationella prioriteringar och ambitioner</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy of Sweden in Kigali has agreed to support MINIRENA to commission the consultancy to develop the effective, efficient and functional M&amp;E infrastructure to support the ENR Sector to determine its contribution to the national sustainable development goals through successful implementation of the sector strategies and other results driven national priorities and aspirations.</narrative>
  </description>
